  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Crazed Demon Cave, Fang Yuan sees a patch of dao marks spread on the ground like a carpet. Lights on its surface form mountains and rivers at times, and birds and animals at others. When other dao marks flood in, the patch flies lightly onto their surface, neither affecting those foreign marks nor crumbling. He judges that if he is not wrong, these are painting path dao marks, but demonic sounds are ringing and he has no method to capture them. He also notes that immortal materials made from gathered painting path dao marks would be reference for creating the corresponding path.",
